	FlowerSatchelItem: {
		DisplayName: Flower Satchel
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Can be used to store potion herbs and flowers.
			You can store up to 3 types of flowers, granting stat bonuses depending on the type, total stack, and combination.
			You can only have one satchel in your inventory at a time.
			Right-click to open/activate the satchel.
